            "detailed_description": "A lab outside the 7th district secretly created a terrible creature.<br>Not long ago, strange radio waves were detected in the lab, and creatures began attacking the city as if they were attracted to something.<br>Soldiers equipped with normal weapons could not defend creatures.<br><br>I will support you with special equipment under test.<br>Protect the city from the attacks of the creatures.<br><br><br>This game is a game that uses the equipment called <strong>[Power Fist]</strong> to destroy enemies.<br><br>It consists of seven missions and survival mode.<br>You can proceed with the upgrade to a point obtained from the mission and Survival mode.<br>In Survival mode, you can compare scores with other users.<br><br>Use <strong>[Reflector]</strong> to reflect the enemy bullets.<br>Then attack with your fists as they approach you.<br>Use <strong>[EX-Mode]</strong> with the power obtained by attacking the enemy to blow away enemies nearby.<br><br>I wish you victory.",
